# With completed tasks hidden, Down and Up in edit mode skip the hidden tasks, keep the caret column, and stop before a project's colon.
file <<END
Errands:
	- Bank @done(2026-10-01)
	- Post office
	- Pharmacy @done(2026-10-02)
	- Hardware store
END
keys gc j <Enter> <Down>
type  (Mon)
keys <Up> <Up>
type  today
keys <Esc>
see ▌ Errands today:
see     - Hardware st (Mon)ore
quit
saved <<END
Errands today:
	- Bank @done(2026-10-01)
	- Post office
	- Pharmacy @done(2026-10-02)
	- Hardware st (Mon)ore
END
